      protocols or keys, or to study, copy or rebuild the design or implementation;
   d) remove, obscure or disable any copyright notice, author attribution, licence
      notice, ad slot, usage statistics or functional limitation, or bypass any
      check, authentication or protection mechanism;
   e) redistribute the Software or any modified, localised, ad-free, cracked,
      renamed or trimmed build through download sites, app stores, public cloud
      links, code hosting platforms, forums, social media, mirrors, torrents or
      aggregators;
   f) sublicense, assign, pledge or otherwise transfer any rights, or treat the
